Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.91,0:15:57.58,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,"PUSAT KOMUNITAS YAMANEKO"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.75,0:16:06.05,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,PUSAT KOMUNITAS YAMANEKO
